<main class="write-main"><h1>Footer visitor statistics</h1><?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>Website visitors · now, month & year</h2><p>Status: <?=e($statistics['status']??'Not refreshed')?>. <a href="<?=url('/write/google#diagnostics')?>">Google diagnostics</a></p><p>The public footer shows visitors (GA4 active users) for Now (Google Analytics realtime activity, measured over the last 30 minutes), the current calendar month and the current calendar year. Calendar periods use the Analytics property’s time zone. Recent activity refreshes each minute; month and year refresh hourly and reset at their calendar boundaries. Only the stream matching this website’s deployed tag is included.</p><p>Missing, thresholded or stale readings stay hidden publicly. No prior-month or lifetime total is relabelled as this month. Consent choices, blockers and processing can affect counts. Public pages never call Google directly.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn primary">Refresh verified statistics</button></form><p>Month: <?=e($statistics['month']??'Not refreshed')?> · Visitors: <?=isset($statistics['monthly_visitors'])?number_format($statistics['monthly_visitors']):'Unavailable'?> · This year: <?=isset($statistics['yearly_visitors'])?number_format($statistics['yearly_visitors']):'Unavailable'?> · Now: <?=isset($statistics['active'])?number_format($statistics['active']):'Unavailable'?></p><p>Realtime diagnostic: <?=e($statistics['realtime_status']??'No failure recorded')?> · Exact single-stream property: <?=!empty($statistics['single_stream'])?'Yes':'No'?></p></section></main>